window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>For fans of:<br> ~Slow-burn fantasy romance<br> ~Protective warriors &amp; fierce heroines<br> ~Hidden powers and fate-bound choices</p> <p><i>The power to see fate is also the power to destroy it.</i></p> <p>Elaris Vaelora has always known her life was not her own. Raised in a remote mountain monastery, she was taught to obey, to remain unseen—until the Lord of Ashcar demands her hand in marriage and summons her to the palace. But the journey south changes everything.</p> <p>Escorted by a company of elite soldiers, Elaris begins to experience visions—fleeting glimpses of other lives, other choices, and countless possible ends. As her power grows, so does her connection to Colin, the captain charged with her protection—whose quiet strength and fierce loyalty challenge everything she thought she knew about duty, destiny, and love.</p> <p>As the truth of her identity unravels, Elaris must face a perilous choice:</p> <p>Follow the path chosen for her… or shatter it and forge her own.</p>"; 
